Q: Custom overload for operator&lt;&lt; for ostream not taken A: <p>Apparently declaration of the overload must be put inside the same brackets as <code>formatter</code> in order for name lookup to work:</p>
<pre class="lang-cpp prettyprint-override"><code>namespace std {
    ostream&amp; operator&lt;&lt;(ostream&amp; os, const my_value&amp; val);

    template&lt;&gt; struct formatter&lt;my_value&gt; {...};
}
</code></pre>
